          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak suuk gea bwatgeat nea gabadiischeesa gaweay nea gagal geatinda ghaadaam, ak ghaayaachi geeshteaba saawa sea fuga silach bugusta nibiyeenya, nea geegali heeda ghamarda, ea eahita madalooda duwayda beasta, ea eahita heeda ghamarda haw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sing'eadi hoowa geesikchi ghuuta dooshta Efraimu, ea eahita dooshta waas, ak geeweayi ea eahita dooshta ghweayeanda, ea Madalooda Hanaeli ea Madalooda Hameya, ea dooshta gisilga; ak geapka ea eehiidu dooshta furiischoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean fuga bwatgeat ea gea badiischeesa ghamiinaada aba gheeda ASEETA, ak aniini ea fuga hees silach bugusta nibiyeenya sea aniini; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ashoohoodiga weay nea ghaghuut durumbeati gaba Eliyakimu, ea Maaseya, ea Miyamini, ea Mikaya, ea Elioenayi, ea Sekariya, ea Hananiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Maaseya, ea Shemaya, ea Eleasari, ea Usi, ea Yehohanani, ea Malkiya, ea Elamu, ea Eseri. Ak fuga sarman gwasarman aba nyeashta haw nea Yesrahiya ea siida mida madeanyaawa gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eaweedida geatayda lukghumajeega saang'a nea geehoosan, aba badayda ASEETA nung' gahoosan saawa muuchi; ak gahoosan eara gadeemga ea diibiga. Ak geayiiy nea sheagi hooseaneega Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Haleanjeeda siitayda bea badiischeesiinda bea gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
