          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean eaweedida gealoat fuga jea gang'ula gijigoonga giidiiwshooda, jea eayiin haghweega madeeda, ea gilagi aba jeeda gea atamanamughuush, siiweamsa hijagi gwadeena gidanyaashta deaweedeeda ashoohoodiga fuga Lawi ghang'eada madameega mujiinajeega; aba gideaba Yuda gahoosan aba badayda ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi gadiiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gang'ula gadiyeeda ASEETA nyaawa ea gadiyeeda giimiinnooda, gawuurji gidasinda fuga sarmani ea furiischoodiga dooshta, gawuurji gidaghayi rukuteayda Dawdi ea orjeedaanyi was Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba damanda Dawdi ea Asafu bea garayi abeeda gwanda siida haw ambal fuga sarmani, bea sarmeeda gwarsiinda nea geebadiischeesa ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fuga Israeli sean damanda Serubabeli ea damanda Nehemiya inyeesa galeagasean geatayda gidagusguseega aba badayda fuga sarmani ea furiischoodiga, ak geasach gea fuga Lawi nea ghwasach fuga Lawi gea orjooga Haruni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.47"
            ]
          }
        }
